  "description": "A comprehensive .NET cryptography library built on BouncyCastle.Cryptography, providing block ciphers (AES, DES, Blowfish, ...), stream ciphers (ChaCha20, Salsa20), RSA public-key cryptography, post-quantum cryptography (ML-DSA, ML-KEM), X.509 certificates (generation, CSR, issuance, PFX, chain validation), hashing (SHA-2, SHA-3), key derivation (PBKDF2, Argon2), padding schemes, and data encoding utilities.",
